===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|medicine}} Something that [[palliate]]s, particularly a palliative [[medicine]].
#: ''The radiation and chemotherapy were only '''palliatives'''.''
#* {{RQ:Landon Lady Anne Granard|page=66|volume=II|passage=Mary heard with sorrow, and fear also, of the projected journey; but the altered expression of Isabella's countenance was a great '''palliative'''—dreadful as it was that her husband should love another...}}

